                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Having seen the development over months, I am impressed by the dedication and quality of the game.\nI can honestly say, I sat for hours the times I could play, and wish I could spend more time on the game, it nags at me while working on my studies, enticing me to a quick 30 minutes, but I have to resist, as it always become an evening and night of gaming.\n\nAll in all, a lovely 9/10, lacking some features for a perfect score, but I would buy it again and again and again, just to support a high quality game!",
